# Windcrag Siege: the Mardu word is "If a creature attacking causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to
# trigger, that ability triggers an additional time" - any creature attacking, not one you control (CR 603.2d, 508.2a).
# Bot1 has Mardu and Curse of Predation enchanting Bot1; Bot2's Llanowar Elves attacks Bot1, and the Curse's "whenever a
# creature attacks enchanted player" triggers twice, putting two +1/+1 counters on Bot2's attacker.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Plains
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Windcrag Siege
Mountain
Curse of Predation
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x5
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Windcrag Siege.Cast
Bot1.Name(Mardu)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Curse of Predation.Cast(Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 3
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Bot1.Life = 17
Bot1.Battlefield.Windcrag Siege.ChosenOption = Mardu
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 3
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Toughness = 3
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
